## Charge 1 — the dissection (card-2 convenience vs essence, per lemma)

The keystone (C136c0) built the supply from the μ₄ operator bank + card-2 collapses.
Splitting each demanded law:

* **`cleared : GENTOW5WCleared`** (row C1) — card-2 was NEVER essence: the landed
